<!--
  Template:Vote / 投票
  ============================================================
  Put this on `Template:Vote` in your wiki.
  Users can then drop the widget on any page via {{Vote|...}}.

  This template uses the <pagerating> extension TAG — tag output is
  NOT passed through MediaWiki's HTML sanitizer, so the <input>,
  <label>, <button> and <script> elements inside the widget render
  correctly. (A parser function would have all those tags escaped.)

  Parameters (all optional):
    {{{background|}}} or {{{1|}}}   image filename or full URL for the background
    {{{title1|}}} or {{{2|}}}       first line of the collapsed card
    {{{title2|}}} or {{{3|}}}       second line (subtitle) of the collapsed card

  Usage examples:
    {{Vote}}                                                             <- defaults
    {{Vote|Clipboard_Screenshot.png|2025第一届|优竞强化月}}              <- image + titles
    {{Vote|background=Clipboard_Screenshot.png|title1=2025第一届|title2=优竞强化月}}
    {{Vote|background=https://example.com/bg.webp|title1=A|title2=B}}    <- remote image
  ============================================================
--><pagerating
    background="{{{background|{{{1|Thebackrooms.jpg}}}}}}"
    title1="{{{title1|{{{2|棍母}}}}}}"
    title2="{{{title2|{{{3|棍父}}}}}}"
/>